Fulfillment Bottlenecks & Order Leakage (OrderStatus)Insight: Order lifecycle status is tracked in the dataset – Shipped, Delivered, Cancelled and Returned. High number of order cancellations and returns impact profitability negatively.  Action Item: Cancellation rates need to be cross-tabulated by Product and ReferralSource to see if particular acquisition channels bring low-intent orders or certain hardware products do not meet expectations.  Promotional Discount Impact (CouponCode)Insight: Approx. 74.25% of orders include coupon codes (SAVE10, FREESHIP, WINTER15) and approx. 25.75% of them are organic.  Action Item: Compare TotalPrice and ItemsInCart for orders including a coupon and for organic orders to see if discounts increase basket value or reduce orders’ prices.  Acquisition Channels Basket Volume (ReferralSource vs. ItemsInCart)Insight: There are social and search acquisition channels which bring in visitors with various ItemsInCart.  Action Item: Compute ROAS for each ReferralSource to focus on the acquisition channels with higher volume of items in cart.
